'''Dangle''' is a [[boss]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'' that can appear in the {{s|Basement}} {{Dlc+|r}} and in the {{s|Burning Basement}}{{dlc-}}.

== Behavior ==
* Fires three projectiles towards Isaac.
* Whistles before summoning 1-3 {{e|Brownie Corn}}s and then fires 3 projectiles at Isaac.
* Quickly performs 2 long dashes towards Isaac while bouncing off obstacles and walls, after which he pauses to catch his breath. While dashing, he leaves slippery [[Creep#Brown Creep|Brown Creep]].
** Occasionally spawns a {{e|Corn Mine}} at the start of a dash, which immediately detonates, poisoning Dangle. If he is poisoned while dashing he leaves behind damaging [[Creep#Green Creep|Green Creep]] instead.
** Brownie Corns caught in his dashes are knocked back a distance.

