== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} Dangle is much less common than his counterpart, {{e|Dingle}}, spawning only 1/4th as often.
* If a {{i|Butt Bombs}} Bomb goes off in the same room as Dangle, it will heal him.
** {{dlc|a+}} Butt Bomb effect on {{i|Dr. Fetus}} or {{i|Epic Fetus}} does not heal Dangle.
* {{i|Flush!}} kills Dangle instantly and causes him to leave behind 6 {{e|Brownie Corn}}s.

== Trivia ==
* He is a corny variant of Dingle.
* Upon death, {{e|Brownie}} will turn into a Dangle with lower HP.
* Dangle has the highest health of any boss fought in [[Chapter 1]].
* Dangle looks slightly similar to Honey Buckets from ''[[wikipedia:Gish (video game)|Gish]]'', one of Edmund McMillen's other games.

